{"sha": "9b06d1121a800cd8b8f0043e1106d1f32afc5a8aa2aa554f21fc8244bf66731c", "body": ["\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:7}", "由\\cref{exo:b1:derivative:3}的切线界经展开改写：", "取 $x = \\frac1n \\in \\intoc{0}{1}$，对 $\\ln(1+x)$ 取泰勒–拉格朗日公式", "（$1$ 阶），得 $\\ln(1 + x) = x - \\frac{x^2}{2(1 +", "c)^2}$，其中 $c \\in \\intoo{0}{x}$，于是", "\\[", "0 \\leq u_n = \\frac1n - \\ln\\Bigl(1 + \\frac1n\\Bigr) \\leq", "\\frac{1}{2n^2} .", "\\]", "与黎曼级数比较可知 $\\sum u_n$ 收敛。其部分和", "的对数项裂项相消：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N} u_n = H_N - \\ln(N+1)", "\\]", "（由于 $\\sum_{n\\leq N} \\ln\\frac{n+1}{n} = \\ln(N+1)$）。故 $H_N -", "\\ln(N+1)$ 收敛；加上 $\\ln\\frac{N+1}{N} \\to 0$ 后，数列", "$H_N - \\ln N$ 收敛，其极限为 $\\gamma \\approx 0.5772$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:8}", "$\\dfrac{1}{n(n+2)} = \\dfrac{1/2}{n} - \\dfrac{1/2}{n+2}$，部分和", "以间隔 $2$ 相消，", "\\[", "S_N = \\frac12\\Bigl(1 + \\frac12 - \\frac{1}{N+1} -", "\\frac{1}{N+2}\\Bigr) \\longrightarrow \\frac34 .", "\\]", "", "$\\sum \\frac{n}{2^n}$：对 $\\abs x < 1$，将有限几何和逐项求导，", "再取极限（本题各级数均绝对收敛，由比值判别法）。", "由 $\\sum_{n\\geq0} x^n = \\frac{1}{1-x}$，", "用部分和直接计算可得", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{N} n x^{n-1}", "= \\frac{1 - (N+1)x^N + N x^{N+1}}{(1 - x)^2}", "\\xrightarrow[N\\to\\infty]{} \\frac{1}{(1-x)^2}", "\\quad (\\abs x < 1),", "\\]", "（边界项 $N x^N \\to 0$）。取 $x = \\frac12$：", "$\\sum_{n\\geq1} n\\bigl(\\frac12\\bigr)^{n-1} = 4$，故 $\\sum_{n\\geq0}", "\\frac{n}{2^n} = \\frac12 \\times 4 = 2$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:9}", "将 $\\sum u_n$ 的项按 $2$ 的幂次分组：", "上界估计：当 $2^k \\leq n < 2^{k+1}$ 时，共有 $2^k$ 项，", "每项均 $\\leq u_{2^k}$：", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{2^{K+1}-1} u_n", "= \\sum_{k=0}^{K} \\sum_{n=2^k}^{2^{k+1}-1} u_n", "\\leq \\sum_{k=0}^{K} 2^k u_{2^k} .", "\\]", "下界估计：同一组中每项均 $\\geq u_{2^{k+1}}$，", "故 $\\sum_{n=2^k}^{2^{k+1}-1} u_n \\geq 2^k u_{2^{k+1}} = \\frac12", "\\cdot 2^{k+1} u_{2^{k+1}}$，于是", "\\[", "\\sum_{n=1}^{2^{K+1}-1} u_n \\geq \\frac12 \\sum_{k=1}^{K+1} 2^{k}", "u_{2^{k}} .", "\\]", "两个部分和的比较均可双向使用（各项非负，", "由\\cref{thm:b1:series:positive}）：两级数敛散性相同。", "", "黎曼级数：取 $u_n = n^{-\\alpha}$，则 $2^k u_{2^k} =", "2^{k(1-\\alpha)}$，为等比级数，当且仅当 $2^{1 - \\alpha}", "< 1$，即 $\\alpha > 1$ 时收敛。贝特朗", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:series:6}）：取 $u_n = \\frac{1}{n(\\ln n)^\\alpha}$，则", "$2^k u_{2^k} = \\frac{1}{(k\\ln 2)^\\alpha}$，为关于 $k$ 的黎曼级数：", "当且仅当 $\\alpha > 1$ 时收敛。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:10}", "公比为 $-t^2$ 的有限等比恒等式：", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{1 + t^2} = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} (-1)^k t^{2k}", "+ \\frac{(-1)^n t^{2n}}{1 + t^2} .", "\\]", "在 $\\intcc{0}{1}$ 上积分（左边的积分为 $\\arctan", "1 = \\frac\\pi4$，见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:arcderiv}）：", "\\[", "\\frac{\\pi}{4} = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\frac{(-1)^k}{2k+1}", "+ (-1)^n \\int_0^1 \\frac{t^{2n}}{1+t^2}\\,\\dd t,", "\\qquad", "0 \\leq \\int_0^1 \\frac{t^{2n}}{1+t^2}\\,\\dd t \\leq \\int_0^1 t^{2n}\\dd", "t = \\frac{1}{2n+1} .", "\\]", "令 $n \\to \\infty$ 即证得该公式，而积分的上述估计", "恰为余项的界：对前", "$N$ 项求和（即 $n = N + 1$ 项）后，$\\abs{R_N} \\leq \\frac{1}{2N + 3}$。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:11}", "$n^{1/n} = \\eu^{\\frac{\\ln n}{n}} \\to \\eu^0 = 1$", "（见\\cref{prop:b1:functions:powerrules}）。于是", "\\[", "\\frac{1}{n^{1 + 1/n}} = \\frac{1}{n}\\,\\eu^{-\\frac{\\ln n}{n}}", "\\sim \\frac{1}{n} ,", "\\]", "由等价判别法（见\\cref{thm:b1:series:positive}）", "与发散的调和级数比较：\\emph{发散}，", "虽然每个指数 $1 + \\frac1n$ 都大于 $1$。黎曼判别法", "针对\\emph{固定}的指数 $\\alpha$；", "指数滑落至 $1$ 时可能丧失全部余量，本例正是如此。", "\\end{solution}", "", "\\begin{solution}{exo:b1:series:12}", "设 $\\varepsilon > 0$。由收敛级数的柯西准则", "（对部分和应用\\cref{thm:b1:seq:complete}），", "存在 $N$，使得 $\\sum_{k=n+1}^{2n} u_k \\leq", "\\varepsilon$ 对 $n \\geq N$ 成立。由单调性，这 $n$ 项中每项均", "$\\geq u_{2n}$：", "\\[", "n\\,u_{2n} \\leq \\sum_{k=n+1}^{2n} u_k \\leq \\varepsilon", "\\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad 2n\\,u_{2n} \\leq 2\\varepsilon ,", "\\]", "对奇数指标，$(2n+1)\\,u_{2n+1} \\leq (2n+1)\\,u_{2n} \\leq", "2\\bigl(2n\\,u_{2n}\\bigr) \\leq 4\\varepsilon$，当 $n \\geq N$ 时，", "两种奇偶性下均有 $n u_n \\to 0$。", ""]}